{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "29ad6f1c-abb9-8666-814d-1ccc5cad8670",
  "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:10:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos K. Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:05:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Carlos Pacheco. I'm calling the storm line because City Hall is closed today. I've got a tree down and I need to know who to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's what this line is for on a weekend. Where's the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "100 Bellevue Avenue. It's in the front yard, near the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 100 Bellevue. Is it down across the sidewalk or the road, or is it all on your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly on my lawn. The top end is over the sidewalk. Not in the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what happened, did it snap or come out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It came out. The roots pulled up out of the ground. There's a big hole and a wall of dirt standing up. That was from the storm that came in Friday and finished today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:06:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the nor'easter, it was a rough one for wind. Okay, writing this down. Root ball lifted, tree down, front yard at 100 Bellevue, partly over the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So who handles it? The city, me, or the electric company? I don't know whose tree it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. It depends on where it was growing. If it's between the sidewalk and the street, in the city right-of-way, that's a city tree and we'd take it. If it was on your side of the property line, it's yours to remove. The utility only comes into it if it's on a wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's not on a wire. I looked. The wires are on the other side of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, then you can skip the utility. How far back from the sidewalk was it standing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe ten feet back. Behind the sidewalk, on the grass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, ten feet back behind the sidewalk, that sounds like private property. But I'll put it in as a report anyway, and a crew can check the part over the sidewalk. If it's blocking the walk, we'd clear that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. I do need the walkway clear today if possible. I've got people coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's going on today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A birthday party for my son. He's seven. It's this afternoon, so the walk matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. Then I'll mark it as blocking a walkway. Crews are stretched thin right now with calls all over town, so I'd expect somebody this afternoon or evening rather than right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I put something across the sidewalk so nobody walks under it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, cones, a chair, tape, whatever you've got. Keep kids away from the root ball too, that dirt can shift."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll rope it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And for getting the rest of the tree cut up and hauled, you'd want a private tree service since it's on your lot. They're probably swamped this weekend too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I'll start calling Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds right. Let me grab a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "0193, got it. And it's Pacheco, P-A-C-H-E-C-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:09:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set, Mr. Pacheco. Report's in for 100 Bellevue, tree down over the sidewalk, root ball up. If anything changes, like it shifts into the road or hits a wire, call right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Enjoy the party."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T13:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
